85 01 04 00 00 95 69 02 06 02  69 04 11 07 04 00 00 05 03 07   # 260-279
04 07 04 69 03 02 05 69 04 58  09 07 04 07 04 69 02 07 06 07   # 280-299
06 07 06 07 06 07 69 01 11 00  69 04 04 07 58 08 69 01 07 04   # 300-319
00 00 02 05 07 04 07 04 69 03  75 11 05 03 69 01 02 07 58 02   # 320-339
69 04 11 07 04 07 04 95 58 04  69 03 85 00 69 02 05 06 58 06   # 340-359
69 01 11 05 06 00 00 95 69 03  04 07 69 01 11 05 03 69 01 07   # 360-379
00 00 00 05 02 07 58 02 69 03  11 02 00 00 06 05 02 07 69 03   # 380-399
05 06 58 04 69 01 11 04 07 69  01 05 06 00 00 06 05 69 03 75   # 400-419
04 01 03 95 69 03 05 03 69 01  58 09 69 02 11 00 69 01 02 05   # 420-439
69 02 02 07 00 00 07 04 00 00  00 00 69 03 11 05 69 02 11 69   # 440-459
00 05 06 00 00 69 01 06 05 69  02 07 04 07 04 07 04 58 04 69   # 460-479
03 95 58 02 04 07 69 01 58 04  05 05 69 04 11 58 02 02 05 69   # 480-499
01 05 03 06 07 07 00 00 00 06  05 69 02 58 06 05 03 69 04 11   # 500-519
07 04 07 04 07 04 07 04 69 03  75 04 07 69 04 58 09 00 69 01   # 520-539
06 05 69 02 11 02 07 69 01 07  00 00 00 00 02 07 06 05 69 02   # 540-559
05 03 02 07 58 06 69 04 11 07  02 95 69 03 85 58 09 05 06 69   # 560-579
01 02 07 00 00 00 00 02 07 02  05 69 02 04 07 58 08 69 04 11   # 580-599
02 07 69 04 58 09 05 03 69 01  58 02 05 06 69 02 05 04 95 69   # 600-619
03 11 69 00 04 07 69 02 07 04  07 04 07 04 02 07 05 03 69 03   # 620-639
11 06 00 07 04 07 04 00 00 00  07 69 03 11 06 02 69 02 05 03   # 640-659
07 04 07 07 00 00 02 07 69 03  11 05 03 69 02 69 03 11 04 07   # 660-679
69 03 11 69 02 11 58 09 69 00  05 06 69 02 11 02 07 00 00 69   # 680-699
03 04 07 69 02 11 05 03 69 02  11 69 02 58 02 05 06 69 03 11   # 700-719
05 06 00 00 00 00 04 07 69 03  11 05 03 00 00 00 00 04 07 69   # 720-739
03 11 05 06 00 00 06 03 69 03  11 05 03 00 00 05 03 69 03 11   # 740-759
06 07 06 07 69 03 11 58 09 98  98 98 98 92 61 00 17 00 00 00   # 760-779


# To simplify things, the keystrokes outlined in the article are automated. When the Preset has finished loading, the invalid
# key code will be in memory. The program would run for a long time, the preset speeds through quickly, and the result
# is visible on the printer tape immediately.
KEYSTROKES:
61  GTO
92  0
92  0
63  8
64  9
21  2nd
64  OP
82  1
62  7
21  2nd
31  Pgm
82  1
